      <kbd>&larr;</kbd><kbd>&rarr;</kbd> move ·
      <kbd>&uarr;</kbd><kbd>&darr;</kbd> deep dive ·
      <kbd>ESC</kbd> overview ·
      <kbd>s</kbd>/<kbd>n</kbd> notes ·
      <kbd>p</kbd> presenter ·
      <kbd>f</kbd> full ·
      <kbd>l</kbd> laser ·
      <kbd>b</kbd> break ·
      <kbd>h</kbd> help ·
      <kbd>alt</kbd>+click zoom ·
