                </li>
              </ol>
              <p class="layers-agent">
                <span class="k">Agent:</span> Model + Harness + Skills in a loop, 
                trying to solve your problem, acting in the environment. <br />
                <em>Effort level:</em> how hard Agent tries to solve. <br />
                Higher effort = more tokens / time / cost.
              </p>
              <p class="layers-tools">
                <span class="k">MCP</span> is an interface to outer world. How
                we communicate with <em>Polarion</em> and <em>Jira</em>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <!-- 2.2.2 — .session -->
          <section class="session" data-section="02 — Terminology" data-session>
            <span class="eyebrow"
              >The session &middot; stepped, press &rarr; to advance</span
            >
