              <span class="h-line"><span>Everything,</span></span>
              <span class="h-line"><span>every turn.</span></span>
            </h2>
            <p class="se-open-line">
              The chat has no memory. The transcript <b>is</b> the memory &mdash;
              so every turn sends all of it again.
            </p>

            <div class="se-stage">
              <div class="se-barwrap">
                <div class="se-bracket" data-se-bracket>
                  <span class="se-bracket-label">sent this turn</span>
                </div>
                <div class="se-column" data-se-column>
